        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Simanyisio sio mung'oosi ooli sichula",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khu malaka ka Sarikoni omwami owa Ashuru, omukhulu we banamae ba Ashuru, ebwaakala lukoba luboofu lwe Bafilisiti Ashitoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu siise esio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi alomaloma khubirira khu mung'oosi Isaya okhwa Amozi, naloma ali, “Cha, wefuule engubo eye kamakunia munda mwowo, ne biraaro,” mala akhola ario, akeenda sichula lundi mu bikele busa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aloma ali, “Nga omukholi wase Isaya nakeendile sichula lundi biraaro mu bikele tawe khu miiko kitaru sino sili nga simanyisio kakhekholekhe khu Misiri ne Esopia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono omwami owa Ashuru alirangirira baambe ba Misiri ne ba Esopia bali mu mbaambe, baele sitube ne bakhulu, bakhakeende sichula lundi mu bikele busa, ne kamatakho kabwe sichula, khuambia Misiri chisoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio babeyikina Kushi ne khukhwibonia sikila Misiri bakhakoyaane ne lilieyikina liabwe likhonakibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bamenywa be khu nyanja yino endaalo eyo baliloma bali, ‘Lola kano kekholekhe khwaabo nibo khweyikina ne naabo nibo khwelukhilayo khunyoola buyeeti ne khuona khukhwama khu mwami owa Ashuru! Nono efwe, khulaonela waena?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
